h1. Dependencies and Risks

*Dependencies:*
* Access to CMS admin panel (https://ide.ioh.co.id/cms/login)
* Active Storage or file upload library configured in CMS Rails app
* CDN configuration for image serving (optional but recommended)
* Platinum Business Hub Homepage implementation completed

*Risks:*
* Large banner files may impact page load performance → Mitigation: Implement strict file size limits and image optimization
* Carousel may not work consistently across browsers → Mitigation: Use well-tested carousel library, cross-browser testing
* Concurrent admin edits may cause conflicts → Mitigation: Implement last-save-wins with admin notifications

*Technical Debt:*
* If existing CMS banner functionality is legacy code, refactoring may be needed
* Image optimization pipeline may need to be implemented if not present

